{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open your restaurant and lead it to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your menu by selecting what dishes to serve. Supply the kitchen accordingly if you do not want to run out of ingredients during service! You can do it yourself, or you can hire a supply manager.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/ae4fcf1b20bd16c7b68d59aba5f73e66.webp?t=1772291345\" width=348 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the doors of your restaurant and start cooking! Cut, blend, grill, bake and fry ingredients: elevate them to make fantastic dishes. Plate the food and bring it to the delivery counter, where waiters will pick it up. Be fast! Guests are not willing to wait forever and may walk out of the restaurant. Line cooks are there to help you, but they also make mistakes. Supervise, coordinate and motivate them! It will take the right combination of carrot and stick to get the best out of your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/76b18b8bfb3b56457ad3a76bc8accb77.poster.avif?t=1772291345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/76b18b8bfb3b56457ad3a76bc8accb77.webm?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/76b18b8bfb3b56457ad3a76bc8accb77.mp4?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/3e3fda171d2d4878c37cb4ab4c4e0e7a.webp?t=1772291345\" width=382 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to be challenged by other Chefs and to display your cooking skills in a 1vs1 Cook-off culinary fight. Impress the audience to earn visibility and improve your reputation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/1fda824dbeb3269d0d9f47826ba2d888.poster.avif?t=1772291345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/1fda824dbeb3269d0d9f47826ba2d888.webm?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/1fda824dbeb3269d0d9f47826ba2d888.mp4?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/1dae5bfc8728d29c48dabdcba5fefdcb.webp?t=1772291345\" width=281 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare delicious desserts in the pastry laboratory. Don't make too many - you want to serve only fresh and tasty cakes to your guests. A pastry chef may help you discover new recipes and will keep your restaurant well-stocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/591cab155279de1effc00cb671b89b1a.poster.avif?t=1772291345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/591cab155279de1effc00cb671b89b1a.webm?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/591cab155279de1effc00cb671b89b1a.mp4?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/c2d0c2d9dd0c733f45f4c37726b2820e.webp?t=1772291345\" width=494 height=63 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire waiters and line cooks, you cannot run a restaurant all by yourself. Select your personnel wisely by checking both technical and moral skills. Assign cooks to the proper station, depending on their capabilities and your needs in the kitchen. Soft skills influence how they react to unexpected events and to your discipline. Experience affects performance, while morale affects loyalty. It is easy to find good workers, it is harder to keep them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire an HR manager if you do not want to deal with all of that\u2026 but delegating it all may hide pitfalls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/93480bd59a7a3b74592b097ecfa48fb0.poster.avif?t=1772291345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/93480bd59a7a3b74592b097ecfa48fb0.webm?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/93480bd59a7a3b74592b097ecfa48fb0.mp4?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/6b308f16520d16a0af0efabc85bbeac8.webp?t=1772291345\" width=329 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your finances in order, running a restaurant is a difficult business and must be profitable too. If you need a cash injection, you can look for partners or for a loan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/9488981b40ea4248ffb9f8cea8f34113.poster.avif?t=1772291345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/9488981b40ea4248ffb9f8cea8f34113.webm?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/9488981b40ea4248ffb9f8cea8f34113.mp4?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/09da59b6b6319306ea2a9c6b29c7e152.webp?t=1772291345\" width=472 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast food, casual or fine dining, no matter what style you pick, the final aspiration of any chef is to run a starred restaurant. Quality and consistency will get you VIP guests, that will boost your reputation and allow you to be visited by an inspector\u2026 but nobody knows when this will happen! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/2e08128eea3fc08f2102fe3d1965b119.poster.avif?t=1772291345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/2e08128eea3fc08f2102fe3d1965b119.webm?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/2e08128eea3fc08f2102fe3d1965b119.mp4?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/0d0062348a84ce886090833514c120c3.webp?t=1772291345\" width=550 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every event and every decision influences your path, making your game absolutely unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/9c79457285417ebdcc6f1071085744a6.poster.avif?t=1772291345\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/9c79457285417ebdcc6f1071085744a6.webm?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/extras/9c79457285417ebdcc6f1071085744a6.mp4?t=1772291345\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2779740?t=1772291345","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2779740?t=1772291345","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/6aa5fee54461f3e580f50c99a2a4f992f2dac525/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772291345","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2779740/6aa5fee54461f3e580f50c99a2a4f992f2dac525/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772291345","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"cont